    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51446" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰχθύ̆βολ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		(parox.) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>striking fish,
				catching fish</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰ. μηχανή</span>
			of the trident, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				132
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴθυιαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.23
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			Subst., <i>fisher, angler</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				7.295
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				9.227
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Bianor</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, (proparox.) <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰ. θήρα</span> a
			spoil <i>of speared fish</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				6.24
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰ. δεῖπνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					3.18
				</span></i>
			.</div>
